Package: datamanual
Title: Document, Check and Move Survey Studies in Shiny
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ethan O.", "Kile", email = "eok5206@psu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Embeds the Data Manual app in R and Shiny. Data Manual reads studies
    from Wear-IT, REDCap, Qualtrics or a spreadsheet into one study specification,
    then produces codebooks, data dictionaries, flowcharts and schedules, edits
    surveys, and exports them to other platforms. This package passes studies
    between R and the app, relays the app's API calls through the R session, and
    reads the API keys saved by the standalone app.
